<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech July real retail sales up 5.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech July real retail sales up 5.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech July retail sales, in real terms, rose 5.7 percent compared with the same month in 1995, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Monday.  </p>
<p> CZECH REAL RETAIL SALES    JULY 96   JUNE 96  JAN-JULY 96</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr	     +5.7	+5.6	 +8.1</p>
<p>Note: All figures are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
